MID_EventLocation_Zaras: Tinieblas de Zahras
MID_EventLocation_Obelisk: Sala de los obeliscos
MID_EventLocation_SeaGod: Dominios de Cetus
MID_EventLocation_Zenzel: Paraíso de Zenzele
MID_EventLocation_MarchingBase: Base de operaciones
MID_EventLocation_Unknown: (?)
MID_EventLocation_SomeWhere: Cierto lugar
MID_EventLocation_OnWay: En camino
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleDagsa: Templo de Dagda
MID_EventLocation_DagsionArena: Coliseo
MID_EventLocation_UnderDagsionArena: Subsuelo del coliseo
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleCarla: Templo de Kalla
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleSmyrnos: Templo de Smyrnos
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleClaire: Templo de Credna
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleAurora: Templo de Aurora
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleJuFas: Templo de Yu Phas
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleJura: Templo de Jurah
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleSoleil: Templo de Solel
MID_EventLocation_DagsionTempleMars: Templo de Mars
MID_EventLocation_CrystalPalace: Palacio de Cristal
MID_EventLocation_NearDagsion: Afueras de Dagsion
MID_EventLocation_RoundTable: Sala de asambleas
MID_EventLocation_Sea: Mar
MID_EventLocation_TheZaratan: El Zaratan
MID_EventLocation_Hideout: Guarida
MID_EventLocation_MountOrgus: Monte Orgus
MID_EventLocation_MountAtla: Monte Atla
MID_EventLocation_UnderWorld: Inframundo
MID_EventLocation_DagsaCauldron: Caldero de Dagda